# The world pilot's inputs, and the feeds and map redesign.py writes for each city, live in a
# Hugging Face dataset; data/world_files.csv lists each with its checksum, and
# python3 data/fetch_world.py downloads them. Riga's stay in git.
/data/cities/*
!/data/cities/riga/
/output/cities/*/redesign/gtfs_*.zip
/output/cities/*/redesign/network.geojson
!/output/cities/riga/redesign/gtfs_*.zip
!/output/cities/riga/redesign/network.geojson
